<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Cabo Delgado have released fishermen they had been holding captive, ending a recent hostage situation. Islamist insurgents continue to target civilians and clash with Mozambican security forces, while a blogger was killed while livestreaming an expose of chromium pollution on a Mozambican road. Chapo has called for cooperation to protect Africa’s strategic minerals, linking mineral security to the conflict zone. The insurgency caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Businessday NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQRkQ4WjNpUnI4RURmS05MU2N3RGZDZi1KYUNvX05JdHliVDlCTlRGeWdzYXZlUGZ4WGZHdUlHVTZlU2J2dExZRXY2VzdqMzhDdUlrSXM4cGpSZTdJM2tZaUlXM0tDUTh6LWZNRjJqYm9ydnN1VkV1Z1FtbktRMURQeVI5Q1h5bVZQd0ZIc3B4ay1RMldYUUMtMWdaUWw5T2lVODVXZE5UdWNxZjA0UmpMc3ZiU1V3Rl8zZWN3Z1N5bVp1c2Q4U3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.christiandaily.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ACI Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPZHo0NWJJTmNfQTdtWHg2R3NONF9oX0NrQUdBcDlLaTkyOGtjbmFQZm5OOGlzY1VCc0gzSUwwc2lub1hZNHFOR256Wmw0M01Vb19zeVFOS3J1aURfLWZfYm0yaGh2eFVSSlVwanhJX1pVRnlxZHp5T3o4MXVXVkczME5OTGNtQ1M1blhSZGRxTW4zVm95cThwUTZ4Y1p3MEl3ZjZTcjZaZW5oQjVSYlNUQmE3NU9vdW1HQ0R1RWtn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOUVhNY0xfOVVkSEVYX0JCNG1pWU9jaktIQ01SVDVkT0dtbzg0Wk9TUTZyQ1ZaY215RXRmZzNnVU15M0U1QWZQSVdTLUxrd1ZFSFNKN1ROODYwNmstdzhnUTViVWx2TzJGM3BWMi00WVZ2c0gwUDVUWkVDOHBPYlE5eGNXYVR0RXpnNjRpZ05KaUh6YU8xUkpETTFfbDhXUVZtWkdv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQSmRWaFRvTld4MHp6V3k4UEhZLVpQamp4UFhTSzd6d2dSSlhT